      "customized": false
    },
    {
      "id": "326",
      "text": "We preserve the organic high-density thickness of natural selection full-grain hides. No surface mechanical sanding, buffing, or heavy synthetic coating takes place. The raw texture and natural variations are intentional features.",
      "type": "text",
      "customized": false
    },
    {
      "id": "327",
      "text": "03 / How do custom allocation queuing pipelines run?",
      "type": "text",
      "customized": false
    },
    {
      "id": "328",
      "text": "Production is limited strictly to synchronized micro-batches to eliminate industrial waste pipelines. Once a batch matrix hits maximum capacity limits, production loops cycle offline for roughly 45 to 60 days.",
      "type": "text",
      "customized": false
    },
