    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-89",
      "text": "A radical challenge to traditional luxury. Raw, industrial structural silhouettes built from extreme wear-rated architectural materials and premium milled calfskins.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "customized": false
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-90",
      "text": "We reject the classical delicate definitions of luxury utility. Our carry systems are treated as portable architectures—crafted with hard-angled self-supporting base geometries, thick dual-pass industrial bonding seams, and custom hardware matrix blocks.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "customized": false
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-91",
      "text": "Every hide undergoes deep aniline mineral processing inside certified local low-emission facilities, yielding intense core strength that retains its structural signature under heavy load dynamics.",
